# =============================================================================
# GitHub Actions secrets required by this repository
# =============================================================================
#
# GHCR publishing uses the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN — no extra secrets needed.
#
# Set these in: GitHub → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions
#
# Secret name   | Description
# --------------|--------------------------------------------------------------
# WARP_API_KEY  | Warp service account API key (obtain from Warp team settings)
